@everyone join us live today for this week's live town <t:1779390000:R> for a behind the scenes look of the groundbreaking for the new Inspiration4 training complex at Space Camp USA, which the MoonDAO community supported with a crowdraise last fall. We'll have Austin and Rosana sharing a bit about their on the ground experience. We'll also have some governance and operations updates and maybe follow the pending Starship launch later today.

Live on YouTube, X, and LinkedIn.
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zIdG-PHCvMg

@everyone join us for this week's live town hall <t:1778180400:R> to meet our new Q2 Cohort and for monthly project updates from active projects.

Live on YouTube, X, LinkedIn:
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6_KOxn8xQhQ

@everyone Join us today for a special conversation about elevating your perspective and pursuing your highest goal, between commercial astronaut Dr. Gretchen Green and Frank White, author of the Overview Effect. Live at <t:1776970800:t> <t:1776970800:R>. 

**Watch now at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EA6PDu0Q1aM**

We've also got a number of *really* important updates, including the mission to send Frank to space, Q2 projects, and retroactive rewards! Join us live on YouTube, X, or LinkedIn.
